      "text": "菲律宾马尼拉年轻人怒了！今日直奔美国大使馆抗议：反对美以袭击伊朗，同时痛斥小马科斯引进美导弹系统，把菲律宾拖入火坑！曾经亲美，如今街头焚旗喊打，呵呵，小马科斯绝对没想到这出反噬！美国霸权全球反弹，中国看戏吃瓜！转发看美帝尴尬！#菲律宾反美 #美国导弹 #伊朗冲突\nManila youth furious today! Heading to US Embassy to protest US-Israel attacks on Iran AND US missile deployments in Philippines under Marcos Jr. regime. Burning flags, chanting against dragging PH into war! LOL, Marcos never saw this backlash coming—once pro-US, now streets revolt! US hegemony backfiring globally.  Share to expose the irony! #PhilippinesProtest #AntiUS",
